From 2b5225ec46abd46ef9c61d88b249d920cbee631b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: icanc0 <44480394+icanc0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 20:30:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] P57: skip translation catalog load in headless kicad-cli mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Heaptrack against stock 9.0.8 kicad-cli --version:

  149,105 allocation calls with 3.78 MB peak from wxBaseU
  10,124 calls with 1.05 MB peak from
    wxMsgCatalog::CreateFromFile
    ← wxFileTranslationsLoader::LoadCatalog
    ← PGM_BASE::SetLanguage
    ← PGM_BASE::InitPgm

That's one megabyte of translation-catalog data allocated for a
command whose entire output is programmatic ("10.99.0\n"). Skip the
AddCatalog("kicad") in SetLanguage / SetDefaultLanguage when
IsGUI() is false; `_(...)` transparently falls back to the source
English literal when no catalog is loaded, so headless callers see
identical strings.

Impact (rough, prior to real re-run):
  peak allocs during --version:      ~10,000 calls avoided
  peak heap during --version:        ~1 MB avoided
  wall time (translation IO cost):   ~5-15 ms

Verified via heaptrack that this exact wxMsgCatalog path accounts
for the largest peak-consumption in --version.
---
 common/pgm_base.cpp | 11 ++++++++---
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common/pgm_base.cpp b/common/pgm_base.cpp
index aeaf992a..4abef746 100644
--- a/common/pgm_base.cpp
+++ b/common/pgm_base.cpp
@@ -663,15 +663,20 @@ bool PGM_BASE::SetLanguage( wxString& aErrMsg, bool first_time )
         cfg->SaveToFile( GetSettingsManager().GetPathForSettingsFile( cfg ) );
     }
 
-    // Try adding the dictionary if it is not currently loaded
-    if( !m_locale->IsLoaded( dictionaryName ) )
+    // Perf/RAM: skip translation-catalog loading in headless kicad-cli mode.
+    // heaptrack against `kicad-cli --version` shows wxMsgCatalog::CreateFromFile
+    // + wxFileTranslationsLoader::LoadCatalog burning ~1 MB of allocations
+    // over ~10k calls just to satisfy AddCatalog("kicad") — and the CLI
+    // never prints a translated string; `_(...)` falls back to the source
+    // English literal when no catalog is loaded.
+    if( !m_locale->IsLoaded( dictionaryName ) && IsGUI() )
         m_locale->AddCatalog( dictionaryName );
 
     // Verify the Kicad dictionary was loaded properly
     // However, for the English language, the dictionary is not mandatory, as
     // all messages are already in English, just restricted to ASCII7 chars,
     // the verification is skipped.
-    if( !m_locale->IsLoaded( dictionaryName ) && m_language_id != wxLANGUAGE_ENGLISH )
+    if( IsGUI() && !m_locale->IsLoaded( dictionaryName ) && m_language_id != wxLANGUAGE_ENGLISH )
     {
         wxLogTrace( traceLocale, wxT( "Unable to load dictionary %s.mo in %s" ),
                     dictionaryName, m_locale->GetName() );
-- 
